      "id": "2065437205359653292",
      "text": "RT @cb_doge: ELON MUSK: \"It is certainly hard to believe that little company that started in a warehouse in El Segundo is now going public.…",
      "created_at": "Fri Jun 12 14:12:58 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": {
        "id": "2065433230883553577",
        "text": "ELON MUSK: \"It is certainly hard to believe that little company that started in a warehouse in El Segundo is now going public. It was the largest IPO ever, and let me tell you, if people had told me this was gonna happen, I was like, man, you must be smoking some really good crack, because I think this company is gonna fail. I gave SpaceX less than a 10% chance of succeeding at all. To be clear, in fact, I told people this. I said, look, we’re probably going to fail, but you know, should give it a try, because if we don’t, if there’s not a new company that enters space, we will never be a truly space-bearing civilization.\"",
