        "text": ".@elonmusk says he was literally “all in” betting everything he owned on Tesla and SpaceX when his third rocket failed and Peter Thiel stepped in to save SpaceX:\n\n“My buddies from PayPal saved my butt.”\n\n“Peter Thiel’s been a big supporter. He invested in SpaceX at an important time in 2008. Before orbit. After our 3rd failure but before success:”\n\n“Big credit to Peter and @LukeNosek and the other guys at @foundersfund. Basically my buddies from PayPal.”",
